WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:04,050
This little job is not a problem for me

2
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:04,970
Don't talk too much

3
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:08,050
There were flowers on the first floor in the afternoon, but I didn’t mention it.

4
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:15,460
Get today's

5
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:20,820
Is it okay if there are so many fish on the shelf?

6
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:22,420
Where are your hands pointing?

7
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:26,120
The firewood has been collected, the water has been filled, and the floor has been swept.

8
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:28,240
Three pieces of dried meat, not one more piece

9
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:30,120
Really stingy

10
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:32,480
So many fish, not even a bite for me

11
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:34,640
Pick it first, then don’t come again

12
00:00:42,390 --> 00:00:43,390
I want to come

13
00:00:51,430 --> 00:00:53,630
It’s not enough to just eat meat. You also have to order eggs.

14
00:00:54,070 --> 00:00:56,110
Go to the old man tomorrow and cut off his nest
